  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>[SECTION DESCRIPTION]</b>

    

    Both zones Respond To: <b>Drag</b>.
    They differ only in <b>Detect Outside</b>.

    

    A drag fires the moment
    the press passes the drag threshold, not when you let go. Press, move a little,
    and the knob flashes while your finger is still down.

    

    Taps are ignored
    by both zones: press and release without moving and nothing happens.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
